em relentlessly until he succeeds not  even letting death stop him I think  having someone unkillable come at you  over and over again is pretty good  punishment perhaps Volker is on  gwyndolin side Gwendolyn is the leader  of the dark moons who hunt down sinners  inside Volkers book of the guilty  gwyndolin wants to find worthy undead to  link the flame and Volk who could simply  be a part of that since she chooses  powerful undead from the asylum through  her crow  interpretation number three is your own  interpretation I can't say I'm right and  I can't say you're wrong because the  game has ever been ended and it's fun to  speculate so based on this information  do you think Volker has a hidden role in  the plot is she playing her hand from  behind the scenes  why
 

